SKILLS - Class abilities

Syntax: skills
        skills all

skills lists native skills for which your character meets the class and level
requirements. skills all lists all 18 native skills with eligible markers or
requirements. This is an eligibility guide, not a promise that a skill can be
used immediately: cooldowns, targets, equipment and conditions still apply.

Use help <skill> for rules and syntax. All classes can hide, search and prepare
for traps. Specialized skills include backstab, bash, charm, circle, haste,
meditate, peek, pick, pray, sneak, steal, teach, touch, track and turn. Monks can
pick locks and sneak; both mages and clerics can teach spells. Touch needs level 10.

The command reads your character without granting skills or changing stats.
Use spells for learned magic, hclass progress for training, and help commands
for the complete command reference. Skill aliases share their original behavior.
